{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claws of Power is a real-time combat casual card game with an adorable art style.<br>Due to certain circumstances, you must become the boss of this turf.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Cats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will collect various feline characters, each possessing unique skills. Once they become part of your paw-squad, spend dried fish to summon them into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=840 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=838 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your base to increase its health, and upgrade your Dried Fish Factory to boost production speed\u2014all of which will greatly aid you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/2143bfe0a9fedd55c87bb205d84e2812.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=826 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/2143bfe0a9fedd55c87bb205d84e2812.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/2143bfe0a9fedd55c87bb205d84e2812.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Acquire special skills that can be used during battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment matching</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different equipment combinations to maximize your cat's abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e49a7c2df265420a0f05ab90ccc7ace2.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=840 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e49a7c2df265420a0f05ab90ccc7ace2.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e49a7c2df265420a0f05ab90ccc7ace2.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lord Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel powerful enough, you can challenge powerful lords and receive generous rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/10fba30a6a3072d708399746164558ad.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=840 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/10fba30a6a3072d708399746164558ad.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/10fba30a6a3072d708399746164558ad.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Socket Gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer one stronghold after another and dominate this land as the ultimate top cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/fae1e84927097e71348151f950428d57.avif?t=1768223756\" width=834 height=298 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998900?t=1768223756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/04f12a08ba7686792c38087bc24b0f06fc3d894e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768223756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/ff4c9bd15c571249b31935c36c3457873eb8129e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768223756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/ff4c9bd15c571249b31935c36c3457873eb8129e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768223756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4108190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claws of Power is a real-time combat casual card game with an adorable art style.<br>Due to certain circumstances, you must become the boss of this turf.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Cats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will collect various feline characters, each possessing unique skills. Once they become part of your paw-squad, spend dried fish to summon them into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=840 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/e3c7a33cbebe2d0b014c1f5c8927bef3.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=838 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.webm?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/27692bc9e70e615d53b90cd3ec687bed.mp4?t=1768223756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your base to increase its health, and upgrade your Dried Fish Factory to boost production speed\u2014all of which will greatly aid you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/2143bfe0a9fedd55c87bb205d84e2812.poster.avif?t=1768223756\" width=826 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998900/extras/2143bfe0a9fedd55c87bb205d84e281